0x0 Inactive
0x1 Continuously (repeat continuously) 
0x2 5 msec
0x3 10 msec
0x4 15 msec
0x5 20 msec
0x6 40 msec
0x7 60 msec (increment is 20 msec steps until 800 msec)
cont....Refer SPSS for rest of encodings";
